flowchart TB
  Expand["Expand schema additively<br/>courses, steps, feedback, audit checkpoints"]
  Legacy["legacy mode<br/>legacy writers only<br/>shared advisory transaction lease"]
  Initial["Initial backfill<br/>lock one playlist and transform one aggregate per transaction"]
  Compare{"Current source and target<br/>fingerprints match the audit?"}
  Skip["Skip an already verified aggregate"]
  Rebuild["Rebuild Course snapshots<br/>preserve IDs, owner, order, feedback, timestamps"]
  Audit["Write source and target fingerprints<br/>plus ordering strategy"]
  Verify["Exact shadow verifier<br/>root counts, ordered snapshots, feedback, sequences"]
  Stop["Stop before native Course activation"]
  Freeze["Deploy the same release in freeze mode<br/>reject every new mutation family"]
  Drain["Acquire exclusive advisory lock<br/>wait for all admitted shared writer leases to drain"]
  Delta["Fingerprint-aware delta backfill<br/>then final exact verification"]
  Activate["course mode<br/>Course writers enabled<br/>legacy mutation routes retired"]
  Contract["Contract phase<br/>legacy tables retained for audit<br/>rollback bounded to the pre-native-write window"]
  Recovery["After activation, recovery is freeze and roll forward<br/>no automatic legacy overwrite of native edits"]

  Expand --> Legacy --> Initial --> Compare
  Compare -->|yes| Skip --> Verify
  Compare -->|no| Rebuild --> Audit --> Verify
  Verify -->|mismatch| Stop
  Verify -->|match| Freeze --> Drain --> Delta
  Delta -->|mismatch| Stop
  Delta -->|match| Activate --> Contract --> Recovery
